C=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill after a successful ground Dodge or {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Normal Attack or Resonance Skill after successful Mid-air Dodge to cast Dodge Counter - Undying Sunlight: Strike, dealing Electro DMG, considered as Resonance Skill DMG.\n- {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} Normal Attack or Resonance Skill during the action to cast Resonance Skill - Undying Sunlight: Leap.\n- Resonance Skill - Undying Sunlight: Leap can be cast again some time after being interrupted.\n\nAscendancy\nAugusta can hold up to {0} points of Ascendancy.\n- Ascendancy is obtained when Normal Attacks deal damage.\n- Casting Intro Skill - Stride of Goldenflare restores {1} Ascendancy.\n- Casting Resonance Skill - Warrior's Blade restores {2} Ascendancy.\n- Casting Resonance Liberation - Sword of Eternal Oath restores {3} Ascendancy.","rows":[{"name":"Resonance Skill - Undying Sunlight: Strike DMG","mult":[{"kind":"pct","hits":[[70,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[75.74,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[81.48,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[89.52,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[95.26,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[101.86,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[111.05,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[120.23,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[129.41,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[139.17,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[150.65,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[162.13,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[173.61,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[185.09,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[196.57,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[208.05,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[219.53,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[231.01,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[242.49,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[253.97,2]]}],"extra":[]},{"name":"Resonance Skill - Undying Sunlight: Leap DMG","mult":[{"kind":"pct","hits":[[112,1],[14,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[121.19,1],[15.15,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[130.37,1],[16.3,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[143.23,1],[17.91,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[152.41,1],[19.06,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[162.98,1],[20.38,2]]},{"kind":"pct","hit